  LegalIndexRecord(code: LegalCode.bnss, section: "129", titleEn: "Security for good behaviour from habitual offenders", oldSection: "110", comparisonNote: "BNS sections replace the corresponding IPC sections Clauses (e) the Protection of Civil Rights Act, 1955; (22 of 1955) and (g) The Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (34 of 2006) is added newly under subsection (f) (i). “Bond with sureties” are replaced by “bail bond”"),
